Package: tailscale
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale
Description: Tailscale mesh VPN (WireGuard-based) for TOS 7
 Tailscale builds a private mesh network between your devices using
 WireGuard. This package runs the official upstream tailscaled daemon
 as a dedicated, unprivileged system user with only the capabilities
 it needs (CAP_NET_ADMIN, CAP_NET_RAW), and serves the upstream web
 console on loopback, reverse-proxied by the TOS web server at
 /tailscale/.
 .
 No extra port is exposed: the console listens on 127.0.0.1:8088 and is
 reached through http://<NAS>:8181/tailscale/. Peer traffic uses UDP
 41641. Node state lives in /var/lib/tailscale.
 .
 Upstream author: Tailscale Inc. Packaged for TOS by Moechz.
